Weather icons in this folder
=============================

These weather symbols are the official YR / Norwegian Meteorological Institute
(met.no) icons, generated from the `@yr/weather-symbols` package.

Icons are copyright (c) 2015-2017 Yr and licensed under the MIT License.

Sources:
- https://github.com/metno/weathericons
- https://github.com/YR/weather-symbols
- https://www.npmjs.com/package/@yr/weather-symbols

